te declared keys, which list linkedFile and linkedTest  2. Run pm update <id> --linked-file path=a.ts  3. Refusal: Unknown option --linked-file"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"One name per concept across MCP and CLI, or an alias so a contract-derived name always parses."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The MCP contract advertises linkedFile/linkedTest; the CLI accepts only --file/--test. The refusal is well-formed but the agent had no way to know from the contract it just read, and the recovery does not name the correct flag."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"mcp/server, sdk/cli-contracts, commands/update"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-6xlyss","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-10T05:53:35.894Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-7rrqsk","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-10T05:53:35.894Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-9rgaal","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-10T05:53:35.894Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-j82fd3","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-10T05:53:35.894Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"ac9d2cd9300a1b57fbda633b46b6350ee7e16475e8ae064663976d84bf16d61f","message":""}
